    ["<Title> Faction Battle </> \n Clubs participating in the Strategic Server will start a one-month Faction Battle based on the finalized factions. Participate in gameplay such as <Highlight> Frost-Fall Lord, Strategic Server City of Dragon Hunting, Club Conquest Decree, and Strategic Server Final Hunt </> to obtain Club God-Chosen Points and compete for God-Chosen seats based on weekly and final rankings. The God-Chosen seats obtained by the Club are distributed internally by the Club management. \n \n <Title> Strategic Preparation </> \n This Strategic Server will open three exclusive strategic preparations: \n <Highlight> Strategic Skills: </> Each Pathway can obtain exclusive Strategic Skills; using them reasonably will have a significant impact on the battle. \n <Highlight> Historical Crystals: </> Players can use Historical Crystals to upgrade Sealed Artifacts to Level 1 and gradually unlock additional slots for equipping Beyonder materials. \n <Highlight> Emperor's Journey: </> Participating in various Strategic Server gameplay can earn Conquest Reputation, which can be used to increase the Strategic Server military rank. \n <Highlight> The above preparations only take effect within the Strategic Server </>. \n \n <Title> God-Chosen Glory </> \n After the Faction Battle ends, the <Highlight> Victor's Declaration </> ceremony will begin. After the ceremony, God-Chosen seat rewards and limited-time divine descent will be distributed uniformly. Subsequently, this server's <Highlight> Trade War </> will be opened based on each Club's God-Chosen Points; stay tuned."] = "<Title> Faction Battle </> \n Clubs participating in the Strategic Server will start a one-month Faction Battle based on the finalized factions. Participate in gameplay such as <Highlight> Frost-Fall Lord, Strategic Server City of Dragon Hunting, Club Conquest Decree, and Strategic Server Final Hunt </> to obtain Club God-Chosen Points and compete for God-Chosen seats based on weekly and final rankings. The God-Chosen seats obtained by the Club are distributed internally by the Club management. \n \n <Title> Strategic Preparation </> \n This Strategic Server will open three exclusive strategic preparations: \n <Highlight> Strategic Skills: </> Each Pathway can obtain exclusive Strategic Skills; using them reasonably will have a significant impact on the battle. \n <Highlight> Исторические кристаллы: </> Players can use Исторические кристаллы to upgrade Запечатанный артефактs to Level 1 and gradually unlock additional slots for equipping Потусторонний materials. \n <Highlight> Emperor's Journey: </> Participating in various Strategic Server gameplay can earn Conquest Reputation, which can be used to increase the Strategic Server military rank. \n <Highlight> The above preparations only take effect within the Strategic Server </>. \n \n <Title> God-Chosen Glory </> \n After the Faction Battle ends, the <Highlight> Victor's Declaration </> ceremony will begin. After the ceremony, God-Chosen seat rewards and limited-time divine descent will be distributed uniformly. Subsequently, this server's <Highlight> Trade War </> will be opened based on each Club's God-Chosen Points; stay tuned.",
